  "title": "Election Commission Withdraws SIR Declaration from Form 6",
  "summary": "The Election Commission (EC) has withdrawn the SIR-related declaration from Form 6 in states where the electoral roll revision exercise has concluded, as the ECINET portal updates the declaration to only apply during the SIR process. This move follows a September 26 meeting of the full Commission, which decided the requirement would only apply during the exercise.",
  "facts": [
